READING IT. At a FIXED token count of 256, with num_warps pinned at
4 and every other tile knob equal, the warpgroup instruction
appears exactly where BLOCK_M % 64 == 0 and nowhere else. THE INSTRUCTION
IS SELECTED BY THE TILE, not by the batch size and not by the warp count.
That closes the loose end on STUDY.md item 3: the 2026-08-27 census saw
the same switch through the config ladder, where the batch, the tile and
num_warps all moved together.

